{{!
    @template theme_dimensions/category_toolbar

    The toolbar of the category showcase: a real GET form that works with
    JavaScript off, drawn as ONE line in the filter line's slot order
    (moodle-dev/docs/filter-line/CONTRACT.md), then the too-short notice, then a
    second row that shows only while something narrows.

    The line (dim-line) holds, in order: the scope - the state chip's values
    criteria::SCOPE names, as counted cells of one radio group, legend visually
    hidden, for a logged-in reader with the state sort on; the pill search
    (dim-line-search) with its eraser; the favourites star (dim-line-star); the
    Filters disclosure (dim-filters); the Organise menu (dim-organise); the view
    toggle (dim-view-row, icons only, List first); core's action menu for the
    category's managers. With no JavaScript the line wraps where it does not fit
    and every control still submits.

    The scope fieldset and the panel's "More statuses" fieldset are ONE radio
    group by name (chip), so a choice holds across both; each carries
    data-region dim-vitrine-group, data-name chip and a data-role (scope, more),
    which is how the client splits the web service's status group between them.
    "More statuses" is drawn hidden while it has no option, so the client has a
    group to paint an option into when an answer brings one.

    The eraser (dim-search-clear) empties the field and searches again. It is a
    client's control (dim-live-only, which both client marks reveal) and is
    hidden while the field is empty; the client shows it as the reader types.

    The favourites toggle combines with the state rather than being one of its
    values, so it is a submit button of its own: it posts fav with the value a
    press turns it to, and aria-pressed says whether it is on. While it is on, a
    hidden field (dim-fav-field) earlier in the form carries fav=1, so every
    other submission keeps it; a press that turns it off posts both, and the
    button's value comes last, which is the one the server reads. The client
    enables and disables that field as it toggles the button (dim-fav). The
    glyph is the course card's own star, solid when pressed; the word and the
    number of favourites are the button's accessible name (dim-fav-count) and
    its tooltip names it.

    The Filters disclosure is a native details element, closed on load: the
    chips row says what narrows. Its summary is the sliders glyph, the word
    (dim-line__label, which the client's folding takes away at narrow widths)
    and the badge (dim-filtercount), which counts what the panel holds and
    nothing the line shows; each of the badge's halves - the digit sighted
    readers see and the sentence a screen reader is read - carries a region,
    because the client rewrites both after every request. The panel holds "More
    statuses", one group per allowlisted custom field, the start-date range
    with its quick options, and the no-JavaScript "Filter" submit.

    The quick date options are ordinary links carrying the two parameters the
    date fields carry, computed on the server in the site's timezone. Either
    date field may be left empty: each bound narrows on its own. The calendar
    is the client's (category_daterange) and speaks the same parameters: it
    mounts its start and end boxes into the empty dim-daterange region, hides the
    native fields (dim-dateinputs) and reads three facts off this markup rather
    than computing them - the first weekday and today's date from the date
    fieldset, and each quick option's bounds from its link - so the client does
    no timezone arithmetic.

    The Organise menu is a native details too: its summary is a glyph whose name
    is a visually hidden word, with a tooltip; inside are the three sort chips
    (dim-sort) and the no-JavaScript "Apply" submit.

    The second row (dim-line-chips) is in the document at every moment and
    carries dim-line__chips--rest while nothing narrows, which takes everything
    in it out of the picture but the count sentence - itself visually hidden
    then and never removed, because it is the page's live region. In it: the
    count (its number in bold, the sentence; Mustache resolves both up the
    context stack from the listing that includes this partial, written on one
    source line because Behat's text assertions do not normalise whitespace);
    one chip per criterion the line does not show, each a link that drops that
    one criterion (dim-chip-remove, data-param naming it), the period's inside
    the dim-daterange-pill region; the "Clear all" link (dim-vitrine-clear,
    dim-clear), drawn from two criteria up; "See all as a list" and the note the
    automatic opening of an area writes.

    Every element the client updates in place is always in the document, hidden
    when it has nothing to say, so the client need not know how to build it: a
    pill's count (dim-pill-count; post-filter, and an option without a count
    shows its label alone, never a zero), the too-short-search notice
    (dim-toolbar-notice) and the clear link. Each filter group's fieldset
    repeats its radio group's name in a data attribute, so the client finds the
    group a returned option belongs to without parsing an id, and the pill track
    is named dim-pill-track so a pill the client creates lands inside it.

    The submit buttons stay inside the form because the template lint renders
    this partial on its own. The first submit of the form is a name-less,
    visually hidden one: Enter in the search box presses the form's first
    submit, and the view buttons carry a name and a value that would otherwise
    flip the reader's view.

    While a panel of the areas is open, hidden fields carry it (open, and psort
    when the panel is in name order), so a filter or a view submitted without
    JavaScript keeps the panel open; each names its own region, because the
    client modules keep them in step with the address.

    The hidden list carries whatever identifies the category on the shell that
    is drawing, and may be empty: a GET submission replaces the action's query
    string, so on the anonymous shell's route the id is a path segment of the
    action and the form needs no field of its own. The control ids are built from
    the category id on the server.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "action": "https://example.com/course/index.php",
        "hidden": [{"name": "categoryid", "value": 7}],
        "formid": "dim-vitrine-form-7",
        "searchid": "dim-vitrine-q-7",
        "searchname": "q",
        "searchlabel": "Buscar cursos",
        "searchplaceholder": "Buscar pelo nome",
        "searchclearlabel": "Limpar texto",
        "query": "resgate",
        "hasquery": true,
        "searchtooshort": false,
        "searchtooshortlabel": "Digite pelo menos 2 caracteres para buscar.",
        "sortgroup": {
            "legend": "Organizar",
            "name": "sort",
            "options": [
                {"id": "dim-sort-7-category", "value": "category", "label": "Por categoria", "checked": true},
                {"id": "dim-sort-7-name", "value": "name", "label": "A-Z", "checked": false},
                {"id": "dim-sort-7-recent", "value": "recent", "label": "Recentes", "checked": false}
            ]
        },
        "sortlabel": "Organizar",
        "sortapplylabel": "Aplicar",
        "scope": {
            "legend": "Situação",
            "name": "chip",
            "hasoptions": true,
            "options": [
                {"id": "dim-chip-7-all", "value": "", "label": "Todos", "count": 14, "hascount": true, "checked": false},
                {"id": "dim-chip-7-enrolled", "value": "enrolled", "label": "Meus cursos", "count": 3, "hascount": true, "checked": false}
            ]
        },
        "hasscope": true,
        "more": {
            "legend": "Mais situações",
            "name": "chip",
            "hasoptions": true,
            "options": [
                {"id": "dim-chip-7-pending", "value": "pending", "label": "Em análise", "count": 1, "hascount": true, "checked": true}
            ]
        },
        "hasmorestatuses": true,
        "favourites": {"name": "fav", "value": 1, "pressed": false, "count": 2, "label": "Favoritos"},
        "hasfavourites": true,
        "facets": [
            {
                "legend": "Modalidade",
                "name": "cf_12",
                "anyid": "dim-cf-12-any",
                "anylabel": "Todos",
                "anychecked": false,
                "options": [
                    {"id": "dim-cf-12-1", "value": 1, "label": "Online", "count": 9, "hascount": true, "checked": true},
                    {"id": "dim-cf-12-2", "value": 2, "label": "Presencial", "count": 5, "hascount": true, "checked": false}
                ]
            }
        ],
        "hasfacets": true,
        "datefromid": "dim-datefrom-7",
        "datetoid": "dim-dateto-7",
        "datefromname": "from",
        "datetoname": "to",
        "datefrom": "2026-09-17",
        "dateto": "2026-09-24",
        "datelegend": "Data de início",
        "datefromlabel": "Início",
        "datetolabel": "Fim",
        "firstday": 0,
        "today": "2026-09-18",
        "datequick": [
            {"label": "Hoje", "url": "https://example.com/course/index.php?categoryid=7&from=2026-09-17&to=2026-09-17", "from": "2026-09-17", "to": "2026-09-17", "current": false},
            {"label": "Esta semana", "url": "https://example.com/course/index.php?categoryid=7&from=2026-09-14&to=2026-09-20", "from": "2026-09-14", "to": "2026-09-20", "current": true}
        ],
        "filterslabel": "Filtros",
        "filtercount": 3,
        "hasfiltercount": true,
        "filtercountlabel": "Filtros aplicados: 3",
        "pagesizename": "perpage",
        "pagesize": 24,
        "haspagesize": true,
        "openfields": [
            {"name": "open", "value": 8, "region": "dim-open-field"},
            {"name": "psort", "value": "name", "region": "dim-psort-field"}
        ],
        "viewname": "view",
        "viewlabel": "Exibição",
        "views": [
            {"value": "list", "label": "Lista", "current": false, "icon": "fa-list"},
            {"value": "cards", "label": "Cartões", "current": true, "icon": "fa-border-all"}
        ],
        "submitlabel": "Filtrar",
        "countnumber": "16",
        "countline": "cursos para “resgate”: 2 nesta categoria e 14 em 4 áreas",
        "seeallurl": "https://example.com/course/index.php?categoryid=7&q=resgate&sort=recent",
        "hasfilters": true,
        "chips": [
            {"param": "cf_12", "label": "Online", "url": "https://example.com/course/index.php?categoryid=7&q=resgate&chip=pending&from=2026-09-17&to=2026-09-24", "removelabel": "Remover filtro", "isperiod": false},
            {"param": "period", "label": "17 setembro 2026 a 24 setembro 2026", "url": "https://example.com/course/index.php?categoryid=7&q=resgate&chip=pending&cf_12=1", "removelabel": "Remover filtro", "isperiod": true},
            {"param": "chip", "label": "Em análise", "url": "https://example.com/course/index.php?categoryid=7&q=resgate&cf_12=1&from=2026-09-17&to=2026-09-24", "removelabel": "Remover filtro", "isperiod": false}
        ],
        "haschips": true,
        "clearall": true,
        "clearurl": "https://example.com/course/index.php?categoryid=7",
        "clearlabel": "Limpar tudo",
        "manageactions": "<div class=\"action-menu\"><a href=\"#\">Manage courses</a></div>",
        "hasmanageactions": true
    }
}}
<form class="dim-toolbar" id="{{formid}}" method="get" action="{{action}}" data-region="dim-vitrine-toolbar">
    {{#hidden}}<input type="hidden" name="{{name}}" value="{{value}}">{{/hidden}}
    {{#haspagesize}}
    <input type="hidden" name="{{pagesizename}}" value="{{pagesize}}">
    {{/haspagesize}}
    {{#openfields}}
    <input type="hidden" name="{{name}}" value="{{value}}" data-region="{{region}}">
    {{/openfields}}
    {{#favourites}}
    <input type="hidden" name="{{name}}" value="1" data-region="dim-fav-field"{{^pressed}} disabled{{/pressed}}>
    {{/favourites}}
    <button type="submit" class="visually-hidden dim-toolbar__defaultsubmit" tabindex="-1">{{submitlabel}}</button>
    <div class="dim-line" data-region="dim-line">
        {{#scope}}
        <fieldset class="dim-toolbar__group dim-line__scope" data-region="dim-vitrine-group" data-name="{{name}}" data-role="scope">
            <legend class="visually-hidden">{{legend}}</legend>
            <div class="dim-line__cells" data-region="dim-pill-track">
                {{#options}}
                <input class="dim-pill__input visually-hidden" type="radio" name="{{name}}" id="{{id}}" value="{{value}}"{{#checked}} checked{{/checked}}>
                <label class="dim-pill" for="{{id}}">{{label}} <span class="dim-pill__count" data-region="dim-pill-count"{{^hascount}} hidden{{/hascount}}>{{count}}</span></label>
                {{/options}}
            </div>
        </fieldset>
        {{/scope}}
        <div class="dim-toolbar__search dim-line__search" data-region="dim-line-search">
            <label class="visually-hidden" for="{{searchid}}">{{searchlabel}}</label>
            <i class="fa fa-magnifying-glass dim-toolbar__searchicon" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            <input class="form-control dim-toolbar__input" type="search" id="{{searchid}}" name="{{searchname}}" value="{{query}}" placeholder="{{searchplaceholder}}" autocomplete="off">
            <button type="button" class="dim-line__eraser dim-live-only" data-action="dim-search-clear" aria-label="{{searchclearlabel}}" title="{{searchclearlabel}}"{{^hasquery}} hidden{{/hasquery}}><i class="fa fa-eraser" aria-hidden="true"></i></button>
        </div>
        {{#favourites}}
        <button type="submit" class="dim-toolbar__star dim-line__iconbtn" name="{{name}}" value="{{value}}" aria-pressed="{{#pressed}}true{{/pressed}}{{^pressed}}false{{/pressed}}" title="{{label}}" data-action="dim-fav" data-region="dim-line-star"><i class="{{#pressed}}fa-solid{{/pressed}}{{^pressed}}fa-regular{{/pressed}} fa-star" aria-hidden="true"></i><span class="visually-hidden">{{label}} <span data-region="dim-fav-count">{{count}}</span></span></button>
        {{/favourites}}
        <details class="dim-toolbar__filters dim-line__filters" data-region="dim-filters">
            <summary class="dim-toolbar__filterstoggle"><i class="fa fa-sliders" aria-hidden="true"></i> <span class="dim-line__label dim-toolbar__filterslabel">{{filterslabel}}</span> <span class="dim-toolbar__filtercount" data-region="dim-filtercount"{{^hasfiltercount}} hidden{{/hasfiltercount}}><span aria-hidden="true" data-region="dim-filtercount-number">{{filtercount}}</span><span class="visually-hidden" data-region="dim-filtercount-label">{{filtercountlabel}}</span></span></summary>
            <div class="dim-toolbar__panel">
                {{#more}}
                <fieldset class="dim-toolbar__group" data-region="dim-vitrine-group" data-name="{{name}}" data-role="more"{{^hasoptions}} hidden{{/hasoptions}}>
                    <legend class="dim-toolbar__grouplabel">{{legend}}</legend>
                    <div class="dim-toolbar__pills" data-region="dim-pill-track">
                        {{#options}}
                        <input class="dim-pill__input visually-hidden" type="radio" name="{{name}}" id="{{id}}" value="{{value}}"{{#checked}} checked{{/checked}}>
                        <label class="dim-pill" for="{{id}}">{{label}} <span class="dim-pill__count" data-region="dim-pill-count"{{^hascount}} hidden{{/hascount}}>{{count}}</span></label>
                        {{/options}}
                    </div>
                </fieldset>
                {{/more}}
                {{#facets}}
                <fieldset class="dim-toolbar__group" data-region="dim-vitrine-group" data-name="{{name}}">
                    <legend class="dim-toolbar__grouplabel">{{legend}}</legend>
                    <div class="dim-toolbar__pills" data-region="dim-pill-track">
                        <input class="dim-pill__input visually-hidden" type="radio" name="{{name}}" id="{{anyid}}" value="0"{{#anychecked}} checked{{/anychecked}}>
                        <label class="dim-pill" for="{{anyid}}">{{anylabel}}</label>
                        {{#options}}
                        <input class="dim-pill__input visually-hidden" type="radio" name="{{name}}" id="{{id}}" value="{{value}}"{{#checked}} checked{{/checked}}>
                        <label class="dim-pill" for="{{id}}">{{label}} <span class="dim-pill__count" data-region="dim-pill-count"{{^hascount}} hidden{{/hascount}}>{{count}}</span></label>
                        {{/options}}
                    </div>
                </fieldset>
                {{/facets}}
                <fieldset class="dim-toolbar__group dim-toolbar__group--date" data-region="dim-date" data-firstday="{{firstday}}" data-today="{{today}}">
                    <legend class="dim-toolbar__grouplabel">{{datelegend}}</legend>
                    <div class="dim-toolbar__daterange" data-region="dim-daterange"></div>
                    <div class="dim-toolbar__dates" data-region="dim-dateinputs">
                        <div class="dim-toolbar__datefield">
                            <label class="dim-toolbar__datelabel" for="{{datefromid}}">{{datefromlabel}}</label>
                            <input class="form-control dim-toolbar__dateinput" type="date" id="{{datefromid}}" name="{{datefromname}}" value="{{datefrom}}">
                        </div>
                        <div class="dim-toolbar__datefield">
                            <label class="dim-toolbar__datelabel" for="{{datetoid}}">{{datetolabel}}</label>
                            <input class="form-control dim-toolbar__dateinput" type="date" id="{{datetoid}}" name="{{datetoname}}" value="{{dateto}}">
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <ul class="dim-toolbar__quick" role="list">
                        {{#datequick}}
                        <li><a class="dim-quick{{#current}} dim-quick--on{{/current}}" href="{{url}}" data-action="dim-quick" data-from="{{from}}" data-to="{{to}}"{{#current}} aria-current="true"{{/current}}>{{label}}</a></li>
                        {{/datequick}}
                    </ul>
                </fieldset>
                <div class="dim-toolbar__actions">
                    <button type="submit" class="dim-toolbar__submit dim-nojs-only">{{submitlabel}}</button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </details>
        <details class="dim-line__organise" data-region="dim-organise">
            <summary class="dim-line__iconbtn dim-line__organisetoggle" title="{{sortlabel}}"><i class="fa fa-arrow-down-wide-short" aria-hidden="true"></i><span class="visually-hidden">{{sortlabel}}</span></summary>
            <div class="dim-line__menu">
                {{#sortgroup}}
                <fieldset class="dim-toolbar__group dim-toolbar__group--sort" data-region="dim-sort" data-name="{{name}}">
                    <legend class="dim-toolbar__grouplabel">{{legend}}</legend>
                    <div class="dim-toolbar__pills">
                        {{#options}}
                        <input class="dim-pill__input visually-hidden" type="radio" name="{{name}}" id="{{id}}" value="{{value}}"{{#checked}} checked{{/checked}}>
                        <label class="dim-pill" for="{{id}}">{{label}}</label>
                        {{/options}}
                    </div>
                </fieldset>
                {{/sortgroup}}
                <button type="submit" class="dim-toolbar__sortsubmit dim-nojs-only">{{sortapplylabel}}</button>
            </div>
        </details>
        <div class="dim-toolbar__view dim-line__view" role="group" aria-label="{{viewlabel}}" data-region="dim-view-row">
            {{#views}}
            <button type="submit" class="dim-toolbar__viewbtn" data-action="dim-view" name="{{viewname}}" value="{{value}}" aria-pressed="{{#current}}true{{/current}}{{^current}}false{{/current}}" title="{{label}}"><i class="fa {{icon}}" aria-hidden="true"></i><span class="visually-hidden">{{label}}</span></button>
            {{/views}}
        </div>
        {{#hasmanageactions}}
        <div class="dim-toolbar__manage">{{{manageactions}}}</div>
        {{/hasmanageactions}}
    </div>
    <p class="dim-toolbar__notice" role="status" data-region="dim-toolbar-notice"{{^searchtooshort}} hidden{{/searchtooshort}}>{{searchtooshortlabel}}</p>
    <div class="dim-line__chips{{^hasfilters}} dim-line__chips--rest{{/hasfilters}}" data-region="dim-line-chips">
        <p class="dim-vitrine__count{{^hasfilters}} visually-hidden{{/hasfilters}}" role="status" aria-live="polite" data-region="dim-vitrine-count"><b class="dim-vitrine__countnumber" data-region="dim-vitrine-countnumber">{{countnumber}}</b> <span data-region="dim-vitrine-counttext">{{countline}}</span></p>
        <div class="dim-line__chiplist" data-region="dim-line-chiplist">{{#chips}}{{^isperiod}}{{> theme_dimensions/category_chip }}{{/isperiod}}{{/chips}}</div>
        <div class="dim-toolbar__pillbar" data-region="dim-daterange-pill">{{#chips}}{{#isperiod}}{{> theme_dimensions/category_chip }}{{/isperiod}}{{/chips}}</div>
        <a class="dim-toolbar__clear" href="{{clearurl}}" data-region="dim-vitrine-clear" data-action="dim-clear"{{^clearall}} hidden{{/clearall}}>{{clearlabel}}</a>
        <span class="dim-vitrine__seeall" data-region="dim-vitrine-seeall"{{^seeallurl}} hidden{{/seeallurl}}><a href="{{seeallurl}}">{{#str}}category_seeaslist, theme_dimensions{{/str}}</a></span>
        <span class="dim-vitrine__countnote" data-region="dim-vitrine-countnote" role="status" hidden><span data-region="dim-vitrine-countnotetext"></span></span>
    </div>
</form>
